  "limitations": [
    "The background token models the actual terminal default. It is not currently a Pi theme slot. A generated Pi theme needs a known/queried terminal background or must explicitly paint it using a code change to Pi; a JSON theme alone cannot set it.",
    "Default terminal foreground and 0-15 ANSI colors also cannot be certified from Pi theme JSON alone.",
    "Four colors {background, toolPendingBg, toolSuccessBg, toolErrorBg} cannot all contrast pairwise at 3:1: three ordered jumps need 27:1 but sRGB WCAG (L+0.05) spans only 21:1.",
    "Provisional 3:1 tool-state fills against background do not ensure state differentiation; with no additional cues, color-only status may still fail WCAG 1.4.1.",
    "ANSI inverse on current search and word-level diffs must be tested on the resulting swapped foreground/background; it is not a fixed semantic-token pair."
  ]
